@* Loads the two client-side validation libraries used across the app:
   - jquery.validate        : provides the actual validation rules
   - jquery.validate.unobtrusive : reads the data-val-* attributes that the asp-for
                                   tag helper emits and wires them to jquery.validate.
   Order matters: validate must be loaded before unobtrusive. *@
<script src="~/lib/jquery-validation/dist/jquery.validate.min.js"></script>
<script src="~/lib/jquery-validation-unobtrusive/jquery.validate.unobtrusive.min.js"></script>
